# Ship-log photo share copy

Per-card X captions live in `web/src/content/posts/photo/shareCopies/*ShareCopies.ts`. They paste after attaching the exported PNG. Do **not** rewrite on-image fields in `*Photo.ts` when only the post caption needs work.

## Structure (each of 15 roles)

1. Opening paragraph: what this image is about (cover, problem, flow, metrics, etc.).
2. One or two short paragraphs that explain the visual, using facts from the companion `*Photo.ts` only.
3. Close with a plain product URL already used by that post (`syraa.fun/...` or full `https://...`) so `shareCopyHasLink` stays true when intended.

Keep export shape: `Record<PostPhotoCardRole, string>`.

## Voice

- Founder-plain, specific, active.
- Prefer commas, periods, and colons. Short paragraphs (1–3 sentences).
- Syra positioning (machine money, pay-per-call, x402) only when the card is about that.

## Forbidden

- Quotation marks wrapping slogans
- Arrow bullets or CTA arrows (`→`, `Try →`, `Test →`)
- Em dashes (`—`)
- Staccato slogan stacks (`One partner. Three chains.`)
- Metric triad one-liners with middle dots (`3 rails · 2 chains · 0 client changes`)
- Empty mantras unless replaced by a concrete explanation of the image

## Allowed

- Numbered `1. 2. 3.` lists for flow, timeline, and checklist cards (still wrap with explanatory paragraphs)
- Plain `syraa.fun/...` or full `https://...` links
- Factual product and partner names from the photo content

## Checklist

- [ ] All 15 roles present and typed
- [ ] Each caption explains the matching card image
- [ ] No forbidden symbols or slogan patterns
- [ ] Facts match companion `*Photo.ts` (no invented features)
- [ ] At least one paste-ready Syra or product link where the post already used one
